0..77 Comment "//! A circuit rule in a `theory` block: a rule whose inputs are a rewrite and"
78..155 Comment "//! two data wires, and whose body wires two nodes. `Theory` codes no circuit"
156..233 Comment "//! rule yet, so the rule is kept beside the block\'s value rather than in it."
234..314 Comment "//! The wiring follows Lafont\'s interaction nets [Lafont-1990-interaction_nets]."
